&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（変動事由の概要）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　単元未満株式の買取りによる増加　24株&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingIssuedSharesAndTreasurySharesTextBlock>
